<title>USA: Schlotzsky's names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Schlotzsky's names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schlotzsky's Inc said on Wednesday it named Monica Gill chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Gill has been acting chief financial officer since June 5 and previously was Schlotzsky's controller, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The post had been left vacant by Charles Harvey Jr., who resigned in June to pursue other interests.</p>
